{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ותתצב.</b> A strange word, for its root is hidden between the two tavs in place of the yod. R. Moses the Cohen said that the tav of לרדת and לגשת is added because of the missing alef from the root פעל, and likewise לדעת, because on account of the guttural letter it is opened, and now the tav has replaced the heh in the word לדעה, like אשר תנה הודך (Psalms 5)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra analyzes ותתצב as a hitpa'el form where the root letters are hidden between the two tavs; the argument turns on Hebrew morphology that resists smooth English rendering."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:31.628717051Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}